#'   \item{PHC_BRAA}{Braak Stage (0 = None 1 = BRAAK Stage I 2 = BRAAK Stage II 3 = BRAAK Stage III 4 = BRAAK Stage IV 5 = BRAAK Stage V 6 = BRAAK Stage VI NA = Not available)}
